# KnowledgeAgent - root environment reference (PLACEHOLDERS ONLY).
# Each service reads its OWN .env file; copy the matching *.env.example:
#   ai-service/.env.example  ->  ai-service/.env   (LLM, embeddings, login/secret key)
#   backend/.env.example     ->  backend/.env      (port, AI service URL, CORS)
#   frontend/.env.example    ->  frontend/.env     (API base URL, optional)
# Never commit a real .env file or any key.
